 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "url is a string. If it has no \"?\" return an empty mapping. Otherwise the query is everything after the first \"?\". Split the query on \"&\" and skip empty pieces. Split each piece at its first \"=\"; the key is the part before it and the value the part after it, or \"\" when the piece has no \"=\". Skip pieces with an empty key. A key that occurs once maps to its value as a string; a key that occurs more than once maps to the list of its values in order of appearance. No percent-decoding is applied.",
  "provenance": [
   {
